        "{a.first}, {a.rel}, organized a 'forest survival' team building {w:far_place}. No food, no phones, one knife for twelve. After six hours, the accountant is eyeing the interns hungrily.",
        "Mandatory team building: a weekend of bungee jumping and 'pushing your limits', organized by {a.first}. The bungee cord looks pre-owned. Very.",
